items.translation:
为给定的查询定义默认排序顺序。<strong>注意：</strong> 可以使用查询方法的显式 <a class="external-link" href="https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html" title="class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain"><code>Sort</code></a> 参数来修改/覆盖这些默认设置。

<pre><code>

                @Query(sort = "{ age : -1 }") // 按年龄降序排列
                List&lt;Person&gt; findByFirstname(String firstname);
</code>
</pre>

items.source:
The name of the index to use. <code>@Query(value = "...", hint = "lastname-idx")</code> can be used as shortcut for:

<pre class="code">@Query(...)
@Hint("lastname-idx")
List&lt;User&gt; findAllByLastname(String collation);
</pre>

items.translation:
要使用的索引名称。可以使用 <code>@Query(value = "...", hint = "lastname-idx")</code> 作为以下内容的快捷方式：

<pre class="code">@Query(...)
@Hint("lastname-idx")
List&lt;User&gt; findAllByLastname(String collation);
</pre>

items.source:
The mode of the read preference to use. This attribute
(<code>@Query(value = "...", readPreference = "secondary")</code>) is an alias for:

<pre class="code">@Query(...)
@ReadPreference("secondary")
List&lt;User&gt; findAllByLastname(String lastname);
</pre>

items.translation:
读偏好模式的类型。此属性（<code>@Query(value = "...", readPreference = "secondary")</code>）是以下内容的别名：

<pre class="code">@Query(...)
@ReadPreference("secondary")
List&lt;User&gt; findAllByLastname(String lastname);
</pre>

items.source:
Defines the collation to apply when executing the query.

<pre class="code">// Fixed value
@Query(collation = "en_US")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByFixedCollation();

// Fixed value as Document
@Query(collation = "{ 'locale' :  'en_US' }")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByFixedJsonCollation();

// Dynamic value as String
@Query(collation = "?0")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByDynamicCollation(String collation);

// Dynamic value as Document
@Query(collation = "{ 'locale' :  ?0 }")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByDynamicJsonCollation(String collation);

// SpEL expression
@Query(collation = "?#{[0]}")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByDynamicSpElCollation(String collation);
</pre>

items.translation:
定义执行查询时应用的排序规则。

<pre class="code">// 固定值
@Query(collation = "en_US")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByFixedCollation();

// 作为文档的固定值
@Query(collation = "{ 'locale' :  'en_US' }")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByFixedJsonCollation();

// 作为字符串的动态值
@Query(collation = "?0")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByDynamicCollation(String collation);

// 作为文档的动态值
@Query(collation = "{ 'locale' :  ?0 }")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByDynamicJsonCollation(String collation);

// SpEL 表达式
@Query(collation = "?#{[0]}")
List&lt;Entry&gt; findAllByDynamicSpElCollation(String collation);
</pre>
